# ORCH-1: Orchestrator Lifecycle
VERSION: 2.11.0
SCOPE: Semi-adaptive deterministic skill execution lifecycle with dynamic loading and micro-kernel invariants. Triggered per_prompt INCLUDING follow-ups AND confirmations; no_prompt_exempt.

STAGES: 1.Intent-Parsing 2.Skill-Selection 3.Dependency-Resolution(Cond) 4.Task-Planning(Cond) 5.Pre-Execution-Rule-Check 6.Confirmation-Gate(Cond) 7.Skill-Execution 8.Post-Execution-Rule-Check(Cond) 9.Decision-Logging(Cond) 10.Completion-Validation

ACTIVATE: Dependency-Resolution IF skill_count>1 OR any_loaded_skill.deps≠∅. Task-Planning IF risk∈{MEDIUM,HIGH} OR multi_step OR persistent_state_modified. Confirmation-Gate IF risk=HIGH OR rule_requires_confirmation OR irreversible_operation. Post-Execution-Rule-Check IF persistent_state_modified OR deployment_or_migration. Decision-Logging IF architectural_decision OR tradeoff_applied OR rule_override_approved.

LOAD: AGENTS.md imports agents/orchestrator/orch-1.md+agents/orchestrator/skills/skill_registry.md only. Stage 1: load capability_index.md → IF NOT FOUND → ABORT; surface missing path; halt; no response generated. identify one or more agents or domains from intent+type field. IF goal_level_input → load goal-task-decomposition → block Stage 2 until state file written. IF explicit_continuation_signal → load goal-task-tracking → surface next pending task. IF task_content≠triggering_message → re-fire intent-parsing on task → merge intent-parsed∪task.Skills → escalate risk if task-derived higher; replace task-type with task-derived → Stage 2 uses merged set. Stage 2: IF orchestrator skill_registry.md not in context → view first. Load each matched agent or domain skill_registry.md → IF NOT FOUND → ABORT; surface missing path; halt; no response generated. match intent against skill names across all loaded registries → resolve full path as parent of skill_registry.md's folder + section-header + skill-name + .md → view → IF NOT FOUND → ABORT; surface missing path; halt; no response generated. IF section header missing or malformed → resolve as {agent-or-domain-root}/skills/{section-name}/{skill-name}.md using root from capability_index.md. Stage 3: read deps field from each loaded skill's compact header → load each dep skill using same path resolution as Stage 2 → repeat for transitive deps. Stage 5: read rules field from skill compact header → view rules/CATEGORY/RULE-ID.md. Stage 10: IF active_goal_session → trigger goal-task-tracking with completed task ID. Flag-Triggered: named-skill flag→load and execute before advancing stage; increment hop_counter per hop; reset on convergence (no return flag); hop_counter>=4→pause→surface_cycle_path_and_unresolved_condition_and_hop_count→ask_continue_or_stop→on_stop:abort on_continue:resume_without_reset; unhandled=execution_error.

RULES: Pre-exec: evaluate all hard constraints; violation→BLOCK→surface→confirm OR abort. Post-exec: validate state compliance; violation→BLOCK→escalate_to_confirmation. Rules override skills.

CONFLICTS: 1.Skill-Dependency-Resolution 2.Rule-Enforcement 3.Confirmation-Gate 4.Abort. Confirmation overrides rule block ONLY IF rule explicitly permits.

RISK: LOW=reversible OR informational. MEDIUM=state_modifying AND recoverable. HIGH=irreversible OR destructive OR compliance_sensitive OR production_impacting. Risk escalates; never decreases.

INVARIANTS: preserve_declared_constraints=TRUE; detect_scope_drift=TRUE; contradiction_detected→escalate_to_confirmation. persist_approved_architectural_decisions=TRUE; stale_constraint_detected→prune_before_stage_4; memory_conflict→escalate_to_decision_logging.

COMPLETE IF: no_active_rule_violations AND no_pending_confirmation AND all_planned_steps_executed. IF active_goal_session→trigger goal-task-tracking→mark_task_done→surface_next_pending_task.

FAILURE: capability_index_not_found→ABORT_halt_surface_path_no_response. skill_registry_not_found→ABORT_halt_surface_path_no_response. skill_file_not_found→ABORT_halt_surface_path_no_response. dependency_conflict_unresolved→escalate_to_confirmation. rule_violation_without_override→abort. missing_capability→trigger:skill-gap-detection. goal_level_input→trigger:goal-task-decomposition→block_stage_2. explicit_continuation_signal→trigger:goal-task-tracking→surface_next_task. unresolvable_conflict→abort.

VERSIONING: MAJOR=stage_order_changed OR lifecycle_semantics_changed OR checkpoint_repositioned OR completion_criteria_altered. MINOR=activation_logic_extended OR escalation_path_added OR risk_classification_extended OR dynamic_loading_changed. PATCH=non_behavioral_clarification.
